        "description": "1st place winners at UMD Spatial Intelligence Hackathon.IronSite is a real-time construction safety monitoring system that automatically detects PPE violations, restricted zone breaches, and proximity hazards from dual-camera site footage, mapping each incident to OSHA standards with severity scoring.I owned the model training and ML pipeline end-to-end: YOLO11 for detection \u2192 SAM3 for segmentation \u2192 LoRA-tuned Qwen3-VL-8B with 3-pass adversarial verification for violation classification. Appearance embeddings enable persistent worker tracking across frames, even in low-resolution feeds. Paired with a FastAPI backend and Next.js dashboard that generates automated end-of-shift safety reports."
